╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮         
│                                                              │         
│ Pager                                                        │         
│                                                              │         
│ Paragraph 1                                                  │         
│ This from-scratch TUI framework talks to the terminal        │         
│ directly via raw syscall ioctls, no golang.org/x/term and no │         
│ Bubble Tea.                                                  │         
│                                                              │         
│ Paragraph 2                                                  │         
│ The event loop follows the Elm Architecture: a Model         │         
│ implements Init, Update, and View, and Program owns the      │         
│ terminal, the input parsing, and a line-level diffing        │         
│ renderer.                                                    │         
│                                                              │         
